        "original_id": "bc23423c-dfa4-5c0a-be59-e7d5ce815ee4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Public Television 19, Inc.\n- Organizations: KCPT, KTBG, KCTV, CBS\n- Places: Kansas City, Missouri, Union Hill, Blue Valley, East 31st Street, 23rd Street, Stark Avenue, Kansas City, Kansas\n- Systems: virtual channel 5, UHF digital channel 24, transmitter tower\n\nFacts:\n- KCPT is owned by Public Television 19, Inc.\n- KCPT maintains studio facilities on East 31st Street in the Union Hill section of Kansas City, Missouri.\n- KCPT shares its studio facilities with sister adult album alternative radio station KTBG (90.9 FM).\n- KCPT's studio facilities are adjacent to the transmitter tower of CBS affiliate KCTV.\n- KCPT's transmitter is located near 23rd Street and Stark Avenue in the Blue Valley section of Kansas City, Missouri.\n- KCTV is a CBS-affiliated television station licensed to Kansas City, Missouri, and it also serves Kansas City, Kansas.\n- KCTV broadcasts on virtual channel 5 and UHF digital channel 24.",
